"**What happened**\n\n(what you saw, and what you expected)\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. \n\n**Setup**\n\nLess Pull 1.4.4 build %@, macOS %ld.%ld.%ld, %lu display(s)\n\n<details><summary>Diagnostics</summary>\n\n```\n%@\n%@\n```\n</details>\n" = "**发生了什么**\n\n（你看到的，以及你预期的）\n\n**步骤**\n\n1. \n\n**环境**\n\nLess Pull 1.4.4 构建 %@，macOS %ld.%ld.%ld，%lu 台显示器\n\n<details><summary>诊断信息</summary>\n\n```\n%@\n%@\n```\n</details>\n";
