"1. On the page that opened, click Load Temporary Add-on….\n2. Select manifest.json in the Browser Extension (Firefox) folder shown in Finder.\n\nFirefox removes temporary add-ons when it quits; load it again next time, or use Firefox Developer Edition with signing turned off. The extension has no buttons: with a website in front, use “Exception for …” in the Less Pull menu. Keep Less Pull where it is installed; run this setup again if you move it." = "1. 在打开的页面中点按“临时载入附加组件…”。\n2. 在访达显示的“Browser Extension (Firefox)”文件夹中选择 manifest.json。\n\nFirefox 退出时会移除临时附加组件；下次请重新载入，或使用关闭了签名检查的 Firefox Developer Edition。扩展没有按钮：网站在前台时，使用 Less Pull 菜单中的“… 的单独设置”。请把 Less Pull 留在安装位置；若移动了它，请重新运行此设置。";
"1. The Less Pull for Safari app opens; click its Open Safari Settings button.\n2. Turn on Less Pull in Settings → Extensions and allow it on all websites.\n\nThe extension has no buttons: with a website in front, use “Exception for …” in the Less Pull menu. Keep Less Pull where it is installed." = "1. “Less Pull for Safari”应用会打开；点按其中的“打开 Safari 设置”按钮。\n2. 在 设置 → 扩展 中开启 Less Pull，并允许它访问所有网站。\n\n扩展没有按钮：网站在前台时，使用 Less Pull 菜单中的“… 的单独设置”。请把 Less Pull 留在安装位置。";
"1. On the store page that opened, click Add to Chrome, then Add extension. Edge asks once to allow extensions from other stores; Opera may first offer its helper for the Chrome Web Store.\n\nThe extension has no buttons: with a website in front, use “Exception for …” in the Less Pull menu. Keep Less Pull where it is installed." = "1. 在打开的商店页面点按“添加至 Chrome”，再点按“添加扩展程序”。Edge 会询问一次是否允许来自其他商店的扩展；Opera 可能先推荐它的 Chrome 应用商店助手。\n\n扩展没有按钮：网站在前台时，使用 Less Pull 菜单中的“… 的单独设置”。请把 Less Pull 留在安装位置。";
