"This app is a gift from the universe to you. It has been fully funded by life.\n\nMy future projects and my work are still being developed, and they benefit from any kind of support: a contribution, telling a friend, or whatever you choose. Thanks for being part of life and making it more beautiful for everyone.\n\n— Jiri Arion Rose" = "这个应用是宇宙送给你的礼物。它的全部费用由生活支付。\n\n我未来的项目和工作仍在成长，任何形式的支持都会有所帮助：一笔捐助、告诉一位朋友，或你选择的任何方式。谢谢你成为生活的一部分，并让它对每个人都更美好。\n\n— Jiri Arion Rose";
